        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/3fac52708b03fbef1a688169b73f2ef2.poster.avif?t=1765246057\" width=1108 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/3fac52708b03fbef1a688169b73f2ef2.webm?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/3fac52708b03fbef1a688169b73f2ef2.mp4?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of a small world and its lore as you progress through platforming obstacles, overcome monsters, and interact with mysterious entities. Like a cat, you have many lives, allowing you to retry and respawn at specific checkpoints. Reach the end to uncover a meaningful message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/5534a34c5a6762916dbb3bdd18098406.poster.avif?t=1765246057\" width=1108 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/5534a34c5a6762916dbb3bdd18098406.webm?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/5534a34c5a6762916dbb3bdd18098406.mp4?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Horizon is a collaborative passion project between friends, created to showcase their love and skills in art, music, multimedia design, and game development. The result is a short but meaningful adventure with a great message.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/3fac52708b03fbef1a688169b73f2ef2.poster.avif?t=1765246057\" width=1108 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/3fac52708b03fbef1a688169b73f2ef2.webm?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/3fac52708b03fbef1a688169b73f2ef2.mp4?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of a small world and its lore as you progress through platforming obstacles, overcome monsters, and interact with mysterious entities. Like a cat, you have many lives, allowing you to retry and respawn at specific checkpoints. Reach the end to uncover a meaningful message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/5534a34c5a6762916dbb3bdd18098406.poster.avif?t=1765246057\" width=1108 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/5534a34c5a6762916dbb3bdd18098406.webm?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139050/extras/5534a34c5a6762916dbb3bdd18098406.mp4?t=1765246057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Horizon is a collaborative passion project between friends, created to showcase their love and skills in art, music, multimedia design, and game development. The result is a short but meaningful adventure with a great message.</p>",
